        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "article"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Thinking Body © with Isabelle Rousseau"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Reclaiming vitality and range of motion, finding rest within movement, building strength and stability: these are a few of the outcomes this class wishes to bring you through the study and embodiment of your skeleton. This accessible practice is self-regulating and readily available to all mobilities. You will be introduced to getting feedback from your body through the use of “test postures” sustained in slow, anatomically optimal positions."
      }
    ],
