        "@value": "Dance artist, Deviani Andrea, will present Islands of Utopia, an interactive performance about options, decision, scarcity and abundance. For this first public performance, dancers Deviani Andrea and Shammy Belmore will present a 20-minutes long choreography in different locations around the city accompanied by an original music score from Aaron Macri."
